{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24586","headline":"戒药 · 白居易","name":"戒药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促促急景中，蠢蠢微尘里。\n生涯有分限，爱恋无终已。\n早夭羡中年，中年羡暮齿。\n暮齿又贪生，服食求不死。\n朝吞太阳精，夕吸秋石髓。\n徼福反成灾，药误者多矣。\n以之资嗜慾，又望延甲子。\n天人阴隲间，亦恐无此理。\n域中有真道，所说不如此。\n後身始身存，吾闻诸老氏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}